 \"What sport does Coneo specialize in?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 63, \"text\": \"Best Outside Hitter award and her team finished in fifth place.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d00\", \"start\": 64, \"end\": 204, \"text\": \"Coneo won the silver medal in the 2014 U23 Pan-American Cup held in Peru, when they lost the gold medal match 1-3 to the Dominican Republic.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d00\", \"start\": 205, \"end\": 366, \"text\": \"She helped her national team to end up in the sixth place in the volleyball tournament held in the 2014 Central American and Caribbean Games in Veracruz, Mexico.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d00\", \"start\": 367, \"end\": 473, \"text\": \"With Liga Bolivarense, she won the 2014 Colombian National Championship in the senior and junior category.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d00\", \"start\": 474, \"end\": 601, \"text\": \"During the 2015 Pan-American Cup, Coneo ranked third among the scorers with 124 points, nonetheless, her national team finished\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 78, \"text\": \"[ 27 ] 2016 In January 2016 , she joined the Italian club Lardini Filottrano .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d01\", \"start\": 79, \"end\": 274, \"text\": \"[ 28 ] In May 2016 , she played the 2016 Summer Olympics qualifier tournament in Puerto Rico , where her team failed the berth to the 2016 Summer Olympics after ranking second in the tournament .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d01\", \"start\": 275, \"end\": 438, \"text\": \"[ 29 ] Coneo participated in the 2016 FIVB Volleyball World Grand Prix [ 30 ] qualifying to the Final Four , [ 31 ] but losing the bronze medal match 2–3 to Peru .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d01\", \"start\": 439, \"end\": 486, \"text\": \"[ 32 ] With her national U22 team , she won the\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 573, \"text\": \"Amanda Coneo : Athlete , Volleyball player ( 1996- ) | Biography , Facts , Information , Career , Wiki , Life People Amanda Coneo peoplepill id : amanda-coneo AC 1 views today 1 views this week Amanda Coneo Biography Lists Also Viewed The basics Quick Facts is Athlete Volleyball player Work field Sports Gender Female Birth 20 December 1996 People who share this birthday Star sign Sagittarius People who share this birthday Age 28 years The details ( from wikipedia ) Biography Amanda Coneo ( born ( 1996-12-20 ) 20 December 1996 ) is a Colombian female volleyball player\"}, \"D4S1\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d03\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 133, \"text\": \"Muriel Coneo Muriel Coneo Paredes (March 15, 1987) is a Colombian Olympic athlete specializing in the middle-distance running events.\"}, \"D4S2\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d03\", \"start\": 134, \"end\": 304, \"text\": \"She won multiple medals on the continental level, including the gold medal in the 1500 m at the 2015 Pan American Games and the 2014 Central American and Caribbean Games.\"}, \"D4S3\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d03\", \"start\": 305, \"end\": 490, \"text\": \"Muriel was born on Isla Fuerte, a Caribbean island belonging to the Bolívar Department, Colombia on March 15, 1987 as the oldest of four sisters between Carlos Coneo and Alicia Paredes.\"}, \"D4S4\": {\"document_number\": 4, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0186-f90d221f59ef:d03\", \"start\": 491, 